                   <item>
                    <widget class="QLabel" name="label_4">
                     <property name="text">
                      <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p align="justify"&gt;Since the system is being controlled by a digital computer, it is a discrete system. To implement a PID with Kp, Ki and Kd tuned in the frequency domain, it needs to be discretized. The system internally discretizes via the Bilinear Transform and using the sampling frequency.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p align="justify"&gt;Two types of PID are implemented:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p align="justify"&gt;&lt;span style=" font-weight:600;"&gt;Positional (absolute) PID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p align="justify"&gt;&lt;span style=" font-weight:600;"&gt;Incremental (velocity) PID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p align="justify"&gt;Look at the microcontroller code (main.cpp) for the implementation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
                     </property>
                     <property name="scaledContents">
                      <bool>false</bool>
                     </property>
                     <property name="wordWrap">
                      <bool>true</bool>
                     </property>
                    </widget>
                   </item>
                  </layout>
                 </item>
